==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Named after the [[Ebola]] River.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Ebola]] [[virus]]|-}} 

# {{context|virology|lang=en}} An extremely contagious [[filovirus]] of African origin that causes [[Ebola fever]], spread through contact with bodily fluids or secretions of infected persons and by airborne particles.

